  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 implements YTRA through separate child axes for
      uppercase letters, lowercase x-height, ascenders, descenders, and
      figures. The transformation changes vertical proportion while preserving
      each glyph’s horizontal construction as far as possible.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — H</h2>
    <p>
      H is a useful control: its height changes through vertical adjustments
      while the vertical stems, crossbar, and horizontal proportions remain
      stable.
    </p>

